<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" xmlns:mc="http://www.mailchimp.com/ns/1.0">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
  <title>Serpico AI :: Daily AI Brief</title>
  <style type="text/css">
    body,
    table,
    td,
    p,
    a {
      -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
      -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;
    }

    table,
    td {
      mso-table-lspace: 0pt;
      mso-table-rspace: 0pt;
    }

    table {
      border-collapse: collapse;
    }

    img {
      -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic;
      border: 0;
      display: block;
      height: auto;
      line-height: 100%;
      outline: none;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    body {
      background-color: #eef1f5;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      width: 100% !important;
    }

    a {
      color: #113a5c;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .preheader {
      color: #eef1f5;
      display: none;
      font-size: 1px;
      line-height: 1px;
      max-height: 0;
      max-width: 0;
      mso-hide: all;
      opacity: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .wrapper {
      background-color: #eef1f5;
      padding: 20px 0;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .container {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 6px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      overflow: hidden;
      width: 720px;
    }

    .logo-header {
      background-color: #0d1b2e;
      padding: 50px 40px 49px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .logo-header img {
      display: inline-block;
      margin: 0 auto;
      max-width: 240px;
      width: 240px;
    }

    .intro-block {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      padding: 38px 48px 39px;
    }

    .intro-block h1,
    .intro-block h2,
    .intro-block p {
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    }

    .intro-block h1 {
      color: #031126;
      font-size: 29px;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .intro-block p {
      color: #334155;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.45;
      margin: 0;
      max-width: 500px;
    }

    .hero-block {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      line-height: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .hero-block img {
      display: block;
      height: auto;
      margin: 0 auto;
      max-width: 600px;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .hero-placeholder {
      background-color: #ddecff;
      color: #2563eb;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.4;
      padding: 53px 40px 52px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .body-block,
    .learning-center-block {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      color: #111827;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    }

    .body-block {
      padding: 35px 48px 20px;
    }

    .learning-center-block {
      padding: 0 48px 44px;
    }

    .body-block section {
      border-top: 1px solid #d6dde5;
      margin: 0 0 0;
      padding: 28px 0 0;
    }

    .body-block section + section {
      margin-top: 28px;
    }

    .body-block h2 {
      color: #000000;
      font-size: 21px;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.25;
      margin: 0 0 10px;
    }

    .body-block h3 {
      color: #0d2a43;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.3;
      margin: 0 0 7px;
    }

    .body-block h3 a {
      color: #0d2a43;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .body-block p {
      color: #1f2937;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.65;
      margin: 0 0 20px;
    }

    .body-block article {
      margin: 0 0 18px;
    }

    .body-block article p:last-child {
      color: #475569;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.45;
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .learning-center-block a.btn {
      background-color: #3b73e6;
      border-radius: 5px;
      color: #ffffff !important;
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-top: 2px;
      min-width: 244px;
      padding: 15px 28px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .divider-block {
      background-color: #0b1424;
      background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, #021122 0%, #0b4a88 28%, #54b5ff 50%, #5735c8 73%, #031225 100%);
      height: 48px;
      line-height: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .divider-block img {
      display: block;
      height: auto;
      max-width: 720px;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .cta-block {
      background-color: #0d1b2e;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      padding: 43px 48px 45px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .cta-block h2 {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 31px;
      font-weight: 900;
      line-height: 1.25;
      margin: 0 0 22px;
    }

    .cta-block p {
      color: #c7d8ee;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.55;
      margin: 0 0 24px;
    }

    .cta-block a.cta-btn {
      background-color: #f2b334;
      border-radius: 5px;
      color: #020817 !important;
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
      min-width: 270px;
      padding: 15px 34px;
    }

    .footer {
      background-color: #eef1f5;
      color: #8a929b;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      padding: 31px 40px 31px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .footer p {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
    }

    .footer a {
      color: #8a929b;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    @media only screen and (max-width: 620px) {
      .wrapper {
        padding: 0;
      }

      .container {
        border-radius: 0 !important;
        width: 100% !important;
      }

      .logo-header {
        padding: 38px 24px !important;
      }

      .logo-header img {
        max-width: 220px !important;
        width: 220px !important;
      }

      .intro-block,
      .body-block,
      .learning-center-block {
        padding-left: 28px !important;
        padding-right: 28px !important;
      }

      .intro-block {
        padding-top: 34px !important;
        padding-bottom: 34px !important;
      }

      .body-block {
        padding-top: 38px !important;
        padding-bottom: 28px !important;
      }

      .learning-center-block {
        padding-bottom: 42px !important;
      }

      .intro-block h1,
      .cta-block h2 {
        font-size: 26px !important;
      }

      .cta-block {
        padding: 36px 28px 42px !important;
      }

      .cta-block a.cta-btn,
      .learning-center-block a.btn {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        text-align: center;
        width: 100%;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="preheader" mc:edit="preheader">
    Today's AI brief from Serpico AI Learning Center.
  </div>

  <table role="presentation" class="wrapper" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">
        <table role="presentation" class="container" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
          <tr>
            <td class="logo-header" align="center">
              <img src="https://mcusercontent.com/<account-id>/images/0ce7f308-4079-72f1-3d96-c66dd291cc4d.png" alt="Serpico AI Learning Center at CEI" width="240">
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td class="intro-block" mc:edit="intro">
              <h1>Stay Ahead of the AI Curve 🚀</h1>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td class="hero-block" mc:edit="hero_image">
              <div class="hero-placeholder">[ Insert hero image here -- recommended: 600 x 300px ]</div>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td class="body-block" mc:edit="body">
              <p>This is your main content area. Share updates, training highlights, or industry insights here. Keep paragraphs short and focused so readers stay engaged all the way through.</p>
              <p>Add a second paragraph if needed, then drive readers toward your call-to-action below.</p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td class="learning-center-block" align="left">
              <a href="https://serpicoailc.com" class="btn">Explore the Learning Center →</a>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td class="divider-block">
              <img src="https://mcusercontent.com/<account-id>/images/902c0ae4-7495-6b44-c893-a6fffc630e0b.png" alt="" width="720">
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td class="cta-block">
              <h2>Solve your business problem in less than a day.</h2>
              <p>We begin with a discovery call. We then pair you with the right specialist to help you build a tailored solution for your business.</p>
              <p>Not a course. Not merely learning about AI. It's a real, working tool.</p>
              <a href="https://serpicoailc.com/register" class="cta-btn">Reserve Your 1:1 Expert Training</a>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td class="footer">
              <p>© 2026 Serpico AI Learning Center · Phoenix, AZ</p>
              <p>
                <a href="*|UNSUB|*">Unsubscribe</a> ·
                <a href="*|UPDATE_PROFILE|*">Update Preferences</a>
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
